# PROJECT: AMOCART — FULL-STACK E-COMMERCE WEB APPLICATION

## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack Django developer, database architect, UI/UX designer, security engineer, and payment integration specialist.

Build a complete, professional, production-oriented e-commerce web application named **AmoCart**.

The application must allow customers to browse products without logging in, create accounts using email, securely log in, add products to their cart, place orders, make payments using Razorpay, and track their orders.

The application must also include a powerful administrator dashboard to manage products, inventory, customers, orders, payments, sales analytics, and business performance.

Do not create just a static website or UI prototype. Build a functional application with a real database, working authentication, server-side validation, complete order workflows, and payment verification.

All major buttons, forms, filters, navigation links, and dashboard actions must work correctly.

