9. After successful authentication, return the customer to checkout.
10. Preserve the cart during authentication.
11. Collect or confirm shipping information.
12. Display the order summary.
13. Revalidate inventory and calculate the final amount on the server.
14. Create a pending order and initiate Razorpay payment.
15. Open Razorpay Checkout.
16. Verify the payment securely on the server.
17. Mark the order as paid only after successful verification.
18. Display an order confirmation page.
